  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.1": "methunaṃ dhammaṃ paṭisevanapaccayā kati āpattiyo āpajjati. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.2": "methunaṃ dhammaṃ paṭisevanapaccayā catasso āpattiyo āpajjati; ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.3": "akkhayite . . . (see ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.4": "chap. 10) . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.5": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.6": "pācittiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.7": "methunaṃ dhammaṃ paṭisevanapaccayā imā catasso āpattiyo āpajjati. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.8": "tā āpattiyo catunnaṃ . . . (see ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.9": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.10": "chap.8) . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.11": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.12": "katīhi samathehi sammanti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.13": "tā āpattiyo catunnaṃ vipattīnaṃ dve vipattiyo bhajanti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.14": "siyā sīlavipattiṃ siyā ācāravipattiṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.15": "sattannaṃ āpattikkhandhānaṃ catūhi āpattikkhandhehi saṃgahitā ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.16": "siyā pārājikāpattikkhandhena siyā thullaccayāpattikkhandhena siyā pācittiyāpattikkhandhena siyā dukkaṭāpattikkhandhena, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.17": "channaṃ āpattisamuṭṭhānānaṃ . . . (chap.8, down ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.18": "to the end ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.19": "of that ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.20": "chapter. Instead ",
  "pli-tv-pvr1.16:1.21": "of karonto read karaṇapaccayā.) . . . tiṇavatthārakena cā ",
